{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">李文星師傅在節目《在家宴客50道菜》中，親自教路炮製「蔥爆鮮鮑魚」。這道菜看似簡單，但要做得鮮甜軟滑其實大有竅妙。只要掌握好大廚的獨家技巧與小提示，在家也能輕鬆煮出媲美高級餐廳的大菜！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e3c5b225-7721-4325-b189-9d41f2d9dda0.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026072kZlGsip1790590107.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e3c5b225-7721-4325-b189-9d41f2d9dda0.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"60fc77b7-2dfb-49b7-8e19-d4c206b4d47b.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026QwbbnymqsI1790590107.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"60fc77b7-2dfb-49b7-8e19-d4c206b4d47b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">食材準備</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大連鮮鮑魚：1斤（約8隻）</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">青蔥：150g</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">薑：20g</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蒜頭：2粒</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">炸蒜蓉：1茶匙</p></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">做法步驟</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">將青蔥切成粗粒，蒜頭與薑切成幼粒備用。</p></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"da0506da-3afa-49ab-835e-81f6ced04171.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026OZoA394Xlr1790590106.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"da0506da-3afa-49ab-835e-81f6ced04171.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大廚貼士</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T09:19:31.083534+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}